OL,3,GNEWSALong period of jobs growth may
OL,4,Ahave ended, figures suggest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA long period of jobs growth in the
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland economy may have
OL,8,Fended, new official figures suggest.
OL,10,FThe data from HMRC shows the number of
OL,11,Fpeople on company payrolls stalled at
OL,12,Fabout 819,000 between April and August.
OL,14,FThe unemployment rate increased
OL,15,Fslightly to 2.4% in July but remains
OL,16,Flow by historic standards.
OL,18,FOther figures suggest employers are
OL,19,Fbecoming more cautious, including
OL,20,Fcutting back on temporary agency
OL,21,Fworkers.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
